{
  "//": [
    "Geometry as data. Every model here is a list of primitives -- no FBX, no",
    "Blender, nothing binary. The editor bakes these into mesh assets; a mod",
    "downloaded at runtime gets the identical part list through the identical",
    "builder, which is why a web mod can ship real models without shipping a",
    "single byte anyone has to trust.",
    "",
    "Origin is ground centre and 1 unit is 1 metre, so y:0 is the floor.",
    "cell names the palette square -- see ModelSpecBuilder.Cells for the list.",
    "Row 7 (e_*) is emissive.",
    "",
    "Primitives: box, plate, wedge, cylinder, cone, pipe, rock.",
    "Budget is a triangle target; going over warns, it does not fail."
  ],

